WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.120
If you were able-bodied you worked, and if you didn’t, it just . . . it was a social stigma not to work.

2
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:11.760
Nobody respected anybody who didn’t work, doing something.

3
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.460
My grandfather would say, “We’re going fishing in the morning.”

4
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:20.860
That meant he’d pick me up at four and we were going to fish until six-thirty and then we’d be at work by seven.

5
00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:24.440
I got to ask this, was anyone gardening by the moon by any chance?

6
00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:28.760
The Farmer’s Almanac is one of best predictors of the weather there is.

7
00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:33.760
Been accurate more than weather forecasters are in the last couple of years.

8
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.300
Yeah, people look at that.

9
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.540
And you had the old things, too.

10
00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:40.160
The African Americans would like to fish along the creeks,

11
00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:47.380
and when the ground was warm enough to plant cotton, they would be able to sit on the ground.

12
00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:53.980
And that was the old wives’ tale: if the African Americans were sitting on the ground, then the ground is warm enough to plant cotton.
